silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_08_kg_cross_reference_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In '08KgcrossreferenceConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the Mittens body-mass observation record from the May 2026 vet visit at Tartu Animal Clinic, entering the engine as a typed quality-claim source packet; also, the Mittens microchip-id witness 985112000123456 entering as a typed identifier source leg into the Music engine cocone; also, the Mittens domestic-cat classification leg (DomesticCat) as a typed source-leg arrow that anchors BY Mittens, not as an identity." .
